<h2>ABSTRACT</h2>
<p>Global food waste and food insecurity remain two of the most pressing socio-economic challenges. FoodCovering 2.0 is an innovative, full-stack web application engineered to bridge this gap by establishing a streamlined, real-time ecosystem for safe food donation and redistribution. The platform leverages simulated Artificial Intelligence (AI) for Food Quality Analysis to evaluate uploaded images of food items to determine freshness and spoilage risk. To facilitate efficient logistics, FoodCovering integrates Live Real-Time Tracking powered by websockets to track active donors, volunteers, and facilities dynamically. The robust Dashboard provides comprehensive data visualization, representing a highly scalable, tech-driven solution to minimize urban food waste while maximizing safe community-driven food recovery.</p>

